    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present this stunning 2 bed, 1 bath, ground floor apartment set in a secure and gated development. The apartment is in great condition and has been well maintained throughout, offering bright and spacious accommodation. Ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike, the property benefits from a private balcony and parking. \n\nInternally, the apartment is well laid out and offers bright accommodation throughout. The property briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with hot press, a spacious open plan kitchen/dining/living area, separate utility room, two generous double bedrooms, and a main bathroom. The accommodation is further enhanced by a private balcony with direct access to the car park.\n\nThis wonderful home is perfectly located in this secure development. The property is a short walk to Howth Junction and Donaghmede DART station and has excellent bus routes allowing easy access to all parts of the capital. There are excellent primary and secondary schools and shops in the immediate vicinity. For those who enjoy the outdoor lifestyle, there are numerous sporting and recreational clubs and amenities in the area. This wonderful home is located close to a choice of restaurants, eateries and the promenade along the coast road. Dublin Airport and connectivity to the M1/M50 are very convenient only about a 20 minute drive away. Viewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 8.1m x 1.0m\nEntrance hall featuring laminate-effect timber flooring, recessed lighting, and hot press\n\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 4.4m\nBright and spacious open plan living room featuring laminate-effect timber flooring, a TV point, and French doors leading out to the balcony while seamlessly connecting with the kitchen area.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 2.1m x 3.1m\nModern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances including a fridge/freezer, oven, hob, extractor fan, and dishwasher. The kitchen features tiled flooring, a tiled splashback, and wood-effect countertops.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.1m x 3.7m\nSpacious double bedroom located to the rear of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and a fitted double wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m x 2.24m\nDouble bedroom located to the rear of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and a fitted wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 1.9m x 2.1m\nWell-appointed bathroom comprising a WC, wash hand basin, and bathtub with shower. The room is finished with tiled flooring and partially tiled walls\n\nUtility - 2.6m x 1.1m\nPractical utility room featuring laminate-effect timber flooring, fitted shelving, and plumbing for a washing machine\n\nBalcony - \nPrivate balcony with decking, offering a low-maintenance outdoor space and direct access to the car park.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>2 bed 1 bath ground floor apartment</li><li>Great condition</li><li>Double glazed windows</li><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>Private parking</li><li>Private gated development</li><li>Private Balcony</li><li>Excellent location </li><li>Close proximity to Dublin Airport and M1/M50</li><li>Management Fee 2000 p.a. approx.</li><li>Approx. 68sqm</ul>"
      },
